ent.\n\nI hope you can understand my decision.\nTo everyone who has played, supported, contributed to, or simply been part of this community:\n\nThank you.\n\nThank you for the memories, the support, and for making Critical Legends what it became.\n\n\n[v4.0.2]\nFull log in our server\n\nEnter the captivating realm of Critical Legends, where epic adventures shape timeless legacies. Traverse forbidden terrain, face exotic foes, and emerge as a legend. Trading within this world is an art—use \"!trade USERNAME\" in Roblox chat, waiting two minutes between trades. All thanks to the visionary Radi Studios, the architects of this wondrous realm!\n\n","path":"/game/8619263259-critical-legends","slug":"8619263259-critical-legends","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/3c3302cc95bf1ccd7eb18b3a0dec2b06d8f78410c6e8ac6e8a90e0beaf53c1df.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-3af2253d2ebead16ed5c9031e88717b9/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":12,"visitor":43444840,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-01-26T14:51:41.798Z","creator":{"name":"Radi Studios","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":9,"freeCount":9,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":2}},{"id":1252559098,"name":"Snow Shoveling Simulator","desc":"❄️Welcome to Snow Shoveling Simulator!❄️\n\nHelp Frosty shovel the endless snow in Winterville and earn money to buy tools, vehicles, pets, much more!\n\nThe rules are simple;\n1. Shovel Snow. 🌨️\n2. Get Dough. 🤑\n3. Have Fun! 🤪","path":"/game/1252559098-snow-shoveling-simulator","slug":"1252559098-snow-shoveling-simulator","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/8728484feccf77eedde7eb2c8e4f516674e61c2600ff4884d676e1d1bc6ab6ea.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-ac40d40790b45b891c9b21e3a1089720/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":12,"visitor":141184345,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-05-08T23:42:57.215Z","creator":{"name":"Virtual Block Studio","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":4,"freeCount":4,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":330361,"name":"Super Fu